":"XLI"}}],"quotes":[{"c":"EME 2025 Q2","e":"eme","d":"2025-07-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tony Guzzi","x":"Macroeconomic uncertainty persists, especially around tariffs and trade.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/06/emcor-group-eme-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2025 Q2","e":"eme","d":"2025-07-31","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Brophy","x":"Have you seen any change or acceleration in conversations with customers just given some of the changing outlook on the tariff discussion in that space?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/06/emcor-group-eme-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2025 Q2","e":"eme","d":"2025-07-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Brent Thielman","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/06/emcor-group-eme-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2025 Q2","e":"eme","d":"2025-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Guzzi","x":"We also executed a successful restructuring in our site-based business, in response to past contract losses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/06/emcor-group-eme-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2025 Q3","e":"eme","d":"2025-10-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Tony Guzzi","x":"AI data centers are gonna grow 20% plus.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/emcor-group-eme-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2025 Q3","e":"eme","d":"2025-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tony Guzzi","x":"Especially around tariffs, trades, and now we have the government shutdown again.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/emcor-group-eme-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2025 Q3","e":"eme","d":"2025-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jason Nalbandian","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/emcor-group-eme-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2025 Q3","e":"eme","d":"2025-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Guzzi","x":"The impact of the successful restructuring in our site based businesses is reflected in this segment's third quarter operating margin expansion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/emcor-group-eme-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2025 Q3","e":"eme","d":"2025-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Guzzi","x":"In addition to the increase in revenue, the operating performance of the segment benefited from a reduction in SG and A margin as we are beginning to see the impact of the restructuring we recently completed within our site based business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/emcor-group-eme-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2025 Q4","e":"eme","d":"2026-02-26","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Anthony Guzzi","x":"We're benefiting more from the AI data center, even though we're building the AI data centers electrically, but the scope doesn't increase as much going from a 100-megawatt cloud storage data center to a 200-megawatt AI data center on the electrical side.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/emcor-eme-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2025 Q4","e":"eme","d":"2026-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Anthony Guzzi","x":"We have restructuring going on in the business all the time where we're restructuring subsidiaries.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/emcor-eme-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2026 Q1","e":"eme","d":"2026-04-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Anthony Guzzi","x":"We see no sign of slowing demand in this vertical, where customer investments in AI infrastructure, cloud infrastructure and overall digital transformation are driving unprecedented levels of activity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/emcor-eme-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2026 Q1","e":"eme","d":"2026-04-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jason Nalbandian","x":"Increased cooling requirements and advancements in liquid cooling, particularly for AI data centers continue to drive opportunities for this segment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/emcor-eme-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2026 Q1","e":"eme","d":"2026-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Anthony Guzzi","x":"But there's 2 places where it's more pass-through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/emcor-eme-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2026 Q1","e":"eme","d":"2026-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Anthony Guzzi","x":"One is, I think we don't even call it pass-through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/emcor-eme-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2026 Q1","e":"eme","d":"2026-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Anthony Guzzi","x":"While we still face slight revenue headwinds within our site-based business, we've begun to see the benefits of the restructuring on the cost side, which reduced overhead costs, and we have a more profitable contract portfolio mix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/emcor-eme-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2026 Q1","e":"eme","d":"2026-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Nalbandian","x":"Also, as Tony mentioned, while we do face some headwinds within our site-based business, the restructuring we did last year has proven to be successful, resulting in both reduced overhead costs and a more profitable contract portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/emcor-eme-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2026 Q2","e":"eme","d":"2026-07-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Anthony Guzzi","x":"We continue to see expanding opportunities as customers invest in AI infrastructure and digital transformation initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/30/emcor-eme-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2026 Q2","e":"eme","d":"2026-07-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Anthony Guzzi","x":"And a lot of that GMP mix that shifted, there's always been an element of more GMP and mechanical, but the shift is really coming into the AI data centers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/30/emcor-eme-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2026 Q2","e":"eme","d":"2026-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Nalbandian","x":"And due to the restructuring actions we completed within our site-based businesses, SG&A margin decreased by 60 basis points.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/30/emcor-eme-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2026 Q2","e":"eme","d":"2026-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Anthony Guzzi","x":"In addition, the restructuring actions we implemented last year in our site-based services business are generating meaningful benefits through a leaner cost structure and a more profitable portfolio of contracts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/30/emcor-eme-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2026 Q3","e":"eme","d":"2026-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Tony Guzzi","x":"Yeah, because I think the more AI data centers become part of the mechanical mix, the designs on those are so much more dynamic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/emcor-eme-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2026 Q3","e":"eme","d":"2026-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Tim Mulrooney","x":"On the data center stuff, sticking with that, I thought I heard you say in the prepared remarks, I want to make sure I heard that right, that the majority of work you are doing today is still on cloud-based data centers, presumably contrasted with the large liquid-cooled AI data centers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/emcor-eme-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2026 Q3","e":"eme","d":"2026-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Brophy","x":"I will pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/emcor-eme-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EME 2026 Q3","e":"eme","d":"2026-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Nalbandian","x":"A more favorable mix coupled with better project execution resulted in a 30 basis point improvement in gross margin, and due in part to the restructuring we completed within our site-based business last year, SG&A margin decreased by 20 basis points.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/emcor-eme-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[62,1,8625,0,0,0,6518,1508],[63,1,9188,0,0,0,8885,0],[64,1,10402,0,0,0,9023,938],[65,1,9773,0,0,0,8388,1153],[66,1,9275,0,0,0,2585,6370],[67,1,9679,0,0,0,2363,6740]],"cinema":[[62,1,8625,0,0,0,6518,1508],[63,1,9188,0,0,0,8885,0],[64,1,10402,0,0,0,9023,938],[65,1,9773,0,0,0,8388,1153],[66,1,9275,0,0,0,2585,6370],[67,1,9679,0,0,0,2363,6740]],"imax":[[62,1,8625,0,0,0,6518,1508],[63,1,9188,0,0,0,8885,0],[64,1,10402,0,0,0,9023,938],[65,1,9773,0,0,0,8388,1153],[66,1,9275,0,0,0,2585,6370],[67,1,9679,0,0,0,2363,6740]],"streaming":[[62,1,8625,0,0,0,6518,1508],[63,1,9188,0,0,0,8885,0],[64,1,10402,0,0,0,9023,938],[65,1,9773,0,0,0,8388,1153],[66,1,9275,0,0,0,2585,6370],[67,1,9679,0,0,0,2363,6740]],"dtc":[[62,1,8625,0,0,0,6518,1508],[63,1,9188,0,0,0,8885,0],[64,1,10402,0,0,0,9023,938],[65,1,9773,0,0,0,8388,1153],[66,1,9275,0,0,0,2585,6370],[67,1,9679,0,0,0,2363,6740]],"ai_spend":[[62,1,8625,0,0,0,6518,1508],[63,1,9188,1,1,0,8885,0],[64,1,10402,2,2,0,9023,938],[65,1,9773,6,5,1,8388,1153],[66,1,9275,5,0,5,2585,6370],[67,1,9679,4,0,4,2363,6740]],"tariffs":[[62,1,86